enterprise processes

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.400
at their own pace
and really build

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:54.400
those differentiating
sets of functionality

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.260
on top of their packaged apps.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.480
And that is really key
for the partnership-- what

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.580
