to those customers

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:02.800
because we deliver
that innovations on two

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.440
level-- on the one hand side
on the infrastructure level

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:09.010
by bringing technologies
to run enterprise

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:12.415
applications from SAP on
containers with Kubernetes,

00:11:12.415 --> 00:11:16.840
Knative, bring them really to
enterprise readiness and scale;

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.270
and on the other hand side,
on the service level, where we

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:23.800
allow customers to seamlessly
consume infrastructure services

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.710
from Google-- be it
machine learning, be it

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:29.500
